WEBVTT

00:04:28.651 --> 00:04:30.173
(Laughter)

00:04:30.173 --> 00:04:33.104
Look at that!

00:04:33.104 --> 00:04:35.569
Now ... look at, look at this! Look at this!

00:04:35.569 --> 00:04:39.016
So what you are looking at here

00:04:39.016 --> 00:04:42.103
has completely changed my life,

00:04:42.103 --> 00:04:45.080
I mean totally changed my life.

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:47.952
Instead of blank stares and awkwardness,

00:04:47.952 --> 00:04:51.436
now it is pointing and smiling!

00:04:51.436 --> 00:04:55.504
People going, "Awesome wheels, dude! Those are awesome!

00:04:55.504 --> 00:04:58.104
I mean, I want some of those wheels!" Little kids say,

00:04:58.104 --> 00:05:00.240
"Can I have a ride?"